acking-wider text-zinc-400 font-normal\">Research · Design · Build · Launch</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <h2 class=\"gs-reveal mt-5 text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.15]\">\n                                Your product is your promise. Ensure it delivers on every interaction.\n                            </h2>\n                            <p class=\"mt-4 text-xs md:text-sm text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed font-light pr-4\">\n                                We engineer platforms that perform flawlessly when the stakes are highest.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-8 text-xs text-zinc-600 font-normal\">lumina.studio</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 2 (Previously Card 1) -->\n            <div class=\"relative rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-white/10 to-transparent p-[1px] shadow-[0_2.8px_2.2px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.034),_0_6.7px_5.3px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.048),_0_12.5px_10px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.06),_0_22.3px_17.9px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.072),_0_41.8px_33.4px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.086),_0_100px_80px_rgba(0,_0,_0,_0.12)]\">\n                <div class=\"flex h-full flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[15px] bg-[#111111]\">\n                    <div class=\"relative h-64 w-full md:h-72 shrink-0\">\n                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/193e1472-0514-44eb-893a-1376091263f3_3840w.jpg\" alt=\"Rugged landscape\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover grayscale contrast-[1.2] brightness-75\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 texture-overlay mix-blend-overlay\"></div>\n\n                        <!-- Overlay: Avatars -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <div class=\"flex -space-x-2 shadow-[0px_2px_3px_-1px_rgba(0,